{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fc04a0d7f34eef69b98022218d092eb263a4a13e91e12cf43a712e18474dd255","ja":"あれっ！　あの激混みしてるお店って……\nアタシらとコラボした製菓会社さんじゃん！","zh":"咦！那家人挤人的店……\n不就是跟我们联名的点心公司嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
