{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3043a6759d4c8abe5d5511f0b91cb5797ea1fb1c7e21a9fd5fd76662f8489899","ja":"うん……。でも……列もすごいし……\nちょっと大変そう、かも……？","zh":"嗯……。但是……排队的人也好多……\n感觉可能会……有点辛苦……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cea8b1836299ea0f76e9d2872220f2acc490a6ce08779608ea8f428bc7daae7d","ja":"チョコの種類が多くて、実演販売もして、\nチョコソフトもあって……人手が足りなさそうだよね。","zh":"巧克力的种类很多，还有现场试吃贩售，\n连巧克力冰淇淋也有……人手看起来不够呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1cbe85af485c08a7fca2e795b64d85f567655167e13fbe32c98bd1059cc1c360","ja":"……ねえ！　何か私たちでお手伝いできないかな？","zh":"……那个！有什么是我们能帮上忙的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"96c2dd6c4656b3f8b748548bbfda6cf64fedbb5d3b3b8c059337f9d3e0bf7fd5","ja":"そうだね、茜ちゃんチョコの明るい未来のためにも\n……じゃなくて。困った人は見過ごせないからね！","zh":"说得对，为了小茜巧克力的光明未来\n……不对。因为不能对遇到困难的人坐视不管呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"28886edefce11be46e65d359068ae9a55355dde2a8a639054d344d070bce62fe","ja":"杏奈も……お手伝い、したい……。\n……ソフトクリーム、巻いてみたい……な♪","zh":"杏奈也……想来帮、忙……。\n……想试着……挤冰淇淋……呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1009.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"61a1a3b1e0eed5b6e80416ab50aa81a2a5c4e3301d972c13cbf418ff66f715c4","ja":"よーし、そうと決まったら……","zh":"好——既然这么决定了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
